cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you mention or cite 1xQuickConvertFormat, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "1xQuickConvertFormat"
abstract: >-
  1xQuickConvertFormat is a macOS menu-bar app by Phạm Xuân Hiếu that converts
  images, video, audio, Office documents, PDF, data files and source code
  locally on the Mac: hold Shift, drag a file in Finder and drop it on a
  format. It also converts Vietnamese documents typed in TCVN3 or VNI fonts
  to Unicode.
authors:
  - given-names: "Xuân Hiếu"
    family-names: "Phạm"
    alias: "Xuan Hieu"
    email: "mail@xuanhieu.org"
    website: "https://xuanhieu.org/gioi-thieu"
url: "https://1x.xuanhieu.org/qcf/en"
repository: "https://github.com/xuanhieu/1xQuickConvertFormat"
license: "LicenseRef-Proprietary"
keywords:
  - macOS
  - file converter
  - HEIC to JPG
  - MOV to MP4
  - Word to PDF
  - TCVN3 to Unicode
  - VNI to Unicode
  - offline
